<title>UK: Siebe has 3 percent of APV, APV says.</title>
<headline>Siebe has 3 percent of APV, APV says.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British process engineering company APV Plc said on Tuesday that engineering giant Siebe Plc had taken a three percent interest in its share capital comprising about 9.2 million shares.</p>
<p>APV said the interest was acquired since Siebe made a 327.4 million stg offer for the company on May 9.</p>
<p>The offer of 0.10955 new Siebe shares for each APV share values APV shares at approximately 105 pence each but there is a cash alternative of 97.5 pence per APV share.</p>
<p>--London Newsoom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
